Domain Entity Actual
    documentation 'This financial entity represents the sum of the financial transactions to date 
                  'relating to a specific account.
    currency AmountToDate
        documentation 'Current balance for the account.
        is required
    date AsOfDate
        documentation 'The date of the reported actual element.
        is part of identity
    reference Account
        documentation 'Account with which the Actual is associated.
        is part of identity